![Photo by Christian Wiediger on Unsplash](cover.jpg)

This simple script can create a new post in your _Wordpress_ using
the data found in a _Youtube_ url.

This is a simple script that will download a _Youtube_ video
thumbnail and upload it to a _Wordpress_ website including the
_Youtube Url_. (Using _Wordpress JSON API_).

```github
NinjasCL/youtube2wordpress | Sube videos de YouTube a WordPress automáticamente
```

## Technologies used

_JavaScript_ Libraries Used:

- [Scrape Youtube](https://www.npmjs.com/package/scrape-youtube)
- [Wget Improved](https://www.npmjs.com/package/wget-improved)
- [Wordpress API](https://www.npmjs.com/package/wpapi)

Be sure to configure your _Wordpress_ with
[Basic Auth Plugin](https://github.com/WP-API/Basic-Auth/issues/35#issuecomment-470532805)
(And _.htaccess_ config) first before using the Rest API.

## Windows

This repo contains a bundled executable with everything you need
(nodejs) to execute the scripts with just a double click. See
[Releases](https://github.com/NinjasCL/youtube2wordpress/releases).

![Screenshot of the script](screenshot.png)

## Usage

You can use any search term (separated by spaces). The first
result will be the video uploaded. The best result is achieved
by using the full url of the video (althought sometimes this can
bring the wrong video).

Use `+` signs to separate words with spaces.

The same as _Youtube Search_ bar, try your query there first. The
first result will be used.

```sh
node index.js "youtube-url1 youtube-url2 youtube-url-n"
```

## Considerations

The script will search the _Youtube_ url and use the first match.
Sometimes _Youtube_ does not return the correct video even when
using the full url. Be sure to test your search queries in
_Youtube_ to create a query that returns your video as the first
result.

## Configure

The file `config.json` contains the configuration needed to
connect with a _Wordpress Rest JSON API_. Ensure that your
_Wordpress_ is properly configured (Check
<https://github.com/WP-API/Basic-Auth/issues/35#issuecomment-470532805>).

